    "itemBodyHtml": "<div class=\"row\">\n\t<div class=\"span6\"><div class=\"passageContent\" xml:base=\"33918_s.xml\"><div class=\"abbi-richtext\"><p class=\"passage-intro\" id=\"p001\">Today you will listen to an audio recording from the book <i>Alice's Adventures in Wonderland.</i> As you listen, pay close attention to details and events as you answer the questions to prepare to write a narrative story.</p></div></div>\n    \t<div class=\"stimulus\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"passage-scrolling passage440\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"passageContent\" xml:base=\"33918.xml\"><div class=\"abbi-richtext\"><p class=\"directions-passage\" id=\"psgi_1i\">Listen to the audio recording from <em>Alice’s Adventures in Wonderland</em>, a book about a young girl who dreams she enters a land filled with talking animals and unusual events. Then answer the questions.</p></div><div class=\"abbi-richtext\"><p class=\"passage-title\" id=\"psgi_p001\">from <em>Alice’s Adventures in Wonderland</em><br/>(Chapter 1 – Down the Rabbit Hole)</p></div><div class=\"abbi-richtext\"><p class=\"author\" id=\"psgi_p002\"><em>by</em> Lewis Carroll</p></div><div class=\"abbi-audio\"><div id=\"audio16688\" class=\"videoaudio\"></div></div><div class=\"abbi-richtext\"></div><div class=\"abbi-richtext\"><p class=\"copyright-tm\" id=\"psgi_p003\">From ALICE’S ADVENTURES IN WONDERLAND by Lewis Carroll—Public Domain</p></div></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"span6\"><div class=\"abbi-richtext\"><h4>Part A</h4></div><div class=\"abbi-richtext\"><p>How does the author mainly develop Alice’s point of view?</p></div>\n\n<ul class=\"int-choice-list  \" data-module=\"ChoiceInteraction\" data-maxchoices=\"1\" data-minchoices=\"1\" data-identifier=\"interaction_RESPONSE_A\">\n<li>\n\t<label class=\"radio\" for=\"choice_5ef6f\">\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-control choiceA1\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"radio\" id=\"choice_5ef6f\" name=\"group_RESPONSE_A\" value=\"A1\" />\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-label\">\n\t\t\tA.\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div  class=\"int-choice-desc \"><p>by including her thoughts and feelings</p></div>\n\t</label>\n</li>\n<li>\n\t<label class=\"radio\" for=\"choice_dcb14\">\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-control choiceB1\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"radio\" id=\"choice_dcb14\" name=\"group_RESPONSE_A\" value=\"B1\" />\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-label\">\n\t\t\tB.\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div  class=\"int-choice-desc \"><p>by including the dialogue that she hears</p></div>\n\t</label>\n</li>\n<li>\n\t<label class=\"radio\" for=\"choice_25cb0\">\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-control choiceC1\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"radio\" id=\"choice_25cb0\" name=\"group_RESPONSE_A\" value=\"C1\" />\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-label\">\n\t\t\tC.\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div  class=\"int-choice-desc \"><p>by creating a mood of fear that affects her</p></div>\n\t</label>\n</li>\n<li>\n\t<label class=\"radio\" for=\"choice_7d34e\">\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-control choiceD1\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"radio\" id=\"choice_7d34e\" name=\"group_RESPONSE_A\" value=\"D1\" />\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-label\">\n\t\t\tD.\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div  class=\"int-choice-desc \"><p>by describing the setting she finds herself in</p></div>\n\t</label>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n<div class=\"abbi-richtext\"></div><div class=\"abbi-richtext\"><h4>Part B</h4></div><div class=\"abbi-richtext\"><p>Which evidence from the passage <strong>best</strong> supports the answer to Part A?</p></div>\n\n<ul class=\"int-choice-list  \" data-module=\"ChoiceInteraction\" data-maxchoices=\"1\" data-minchoices=\"1\" data-identifier=\"interaction_RESPONSE_B\">\n<li>\n\t<label class=\"radio\" for=\"choice_79aa3\">\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-control choiceA2\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"radio\" id=\"choice_79aa3\" name=\"group_RESPONSE_B\" value=\"A2\" />\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-label\">\n\t\t\tA.\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div  class=\"int-choice-desc \"><p>“‘Oh dear! Oh dear! I shall be late!’” [0:47–0:49]</p></div>\n\t</label>\n</li>\n<li>\n\t<label class=\"radio\" for=\"choice_d999c\">\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-control choiceB2\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"radio\" id=\"choice_d999c\" name=\"group_RESPONSE_B\" value=\"B2\" />\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-label\">\n\t\t\tB.\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div  class=\"int-choice-desc \"><p>“. . . she fell very slowly . . . .” [1:49–1:50]</p></div>\n\t</label>\n</li>\n<li>\n\t<label class=\"radio\" for=\"choice_f048f\">\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-control choiceC2\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"radio\" id=\"choice_f048f\" name=\"group_RESPONSE_B\" value=\"C2\" />\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-label\">\n\t\t\tC.\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div  class=\"int-choice-desc \"><p>“Here and there she saw maps and pictures hung upon pegs.” [2:08–2:12]</p></div>\n\t</label>\n</li>\n<li>\n\t<label class=\"radio\" for=\"choice_b649e\">\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-control choiceD2\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"radio\" id=\"choice_b649e\" name=\"group_RESPONSE_B\" value=\"D2\" />\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-label\">\n\t\t\tD.\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div  class=\"int-choice-desc \"><p>“‘How brave they’ll all think me at home!’” [2:37–2:38]</p></div>\n\t</label>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n",
